        <string>/Users/megan/1st Claude Folder</string>
    </dict>

    <!-- Every 30 minutes, 07:05-21:35 machine-local (Lucy 2 is Central).
         :05/:35 on purpose: clear of the daily full-org pass at 07:50 (whose
         first minutes matter most) and of applicant_tracker's :45 imports.
         No overnight ticks — the applicant push window is 7am-10pm, and the
         1am recruiting chain owns the AppStream session at night. A tick that
         lands while the full-org pass (or any ad_sales_board run) is going
         exits on the wrapper's pgrep guard; the next one is 30 min away.

         TIME KNOB: edit this array, then re-install:
           lucy rerun install_ad_sales_board_carlos_agent  (machine: Lucy 2) -->
